{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1319692-lfp-ex3-what-lies-buried-in-the-sands","id":1319692,"title":"[LFP] EX3 - What lies buried in the sands","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-06-20T06:28:52-07:00","id":1319692,"title":"[LFP] EX3 - What lies buried in the sands","content":"HORA HORA HORA-HORA-HORA!!!<br /> <br /> Calling anyone interested in an Exalted 3e play by post.<br /> <br /> <b>Game?</b> Dragonblooded!<br /> <br /> <b>Setting!?</b> A clutch of dragons spearhead a relic dig in the southern deserts and unearth an ancient Solar ghost. They ruled the region Millenia ago and offers hints and help to a burgeoning nation led by princes of the earth!!<br /> <br /> <b>Will feature;</b> nation building using hacked rules and political games with the realm wanting a slice of the pie.<br /> <br /> <b>Looking for!?</b> 3 additional players. Get in while it\u2019s hot!<br /> <br /> <b>House rules!?</b> generally none. But if you have your heart set on something we can talk. We will be using my hacked rules \u2018Dominion Ruling Cadence\u2019 based on the kingdom system from Pathfinder\u2019s Ultimate Campaign which I have designed to play into the \u2018west wing-esque\u2019 design philosophy of EX3\u2019s project system while also giving a bit more mechanical bite for those who wish to invest more heavily. <br /> <br /> Either reply here or send me a DM. We\u2019ll be managing the campaign via the awesome <a href=\"https://www.lotcastingatemi.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Lot-Casting Atemi</a> and selecting a place to play through the chronicle based on the preferences of the group as a whole. <br /> <br /> Thanks for your time. =)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(10chars)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2721-elkovash","name":"Elkovash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2721_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"528"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-20T07:33:44-07:00","id":1319703,"title":"","content":"As one of the already in players i'll let people know the character concept I have. Slip is a water aspected thief. Very sure of herself. Talented in petty larceny and somehow despite her behavior, quite canny. She works as a disgraced member of the realm, a rabble rousing outcaste, a lookshyan who isn't exactly keen on the whole MILITARY LIYFE, what have you. so her background can be in flux to fit with whatever is really needed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-20T07:44:35-07:00","id":1319712,"title":"","content":"I have multiple concepts for flexibility, but I'm favoring an Earth Aspect focused on Craft and Awareness, or a Wood Aspect focused on Craft and Performance. Either would be the expedition's relic-scholar. Both ideas are probably Dynasts. Probably going Wood unless someone else is like, super set on Wood.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8026,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","user":"Beans","date":". 06-20-2019, 04:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"ke